      "content": "idk, it just feels different this time. it's not just being tired. it's like... the symphony is finished. if you keep playing after the final note, you're just making noise. why wait for the instruments to break and the melody to get sloppy? wouldn't it be more beautiful to just... stop while the music is still perfect?",
